    <summary>Fleet is a code editor designed for simplicity, combining a clean UI, AI capabilities,
      and an essential set of built-in features for most major languages.</summary>
    <description>
      # Fleet
      Fleet is a code editor designed for simplicity, combining a clean UI, AI capabilities, and an
      essential set of built-in features for most major languages.
      ## Supercharge your development with AI Assistant
      Could you benefit from smarter code completion? Do you need to understand your codebase
      better? Are you struggling to write documentation? AI Assistant in Fleet is here to help.
      Boost your productivity and enjoy an exceptional developer experience with Fleet's AI-powered
      features.
      ## Switch between languages - not tools
      Do you enjoy working with different programming languages in the same project? Well, we’ve got
      you covered! With Fleet, you can start coding in the language of your choice. Fleet is
      designed to automatically detect your project configuration from the source code, maximizing
      the value you get from its smart code-processing engine while minimizing the need for project
      configuration.
      ## Simplified
      We built Fleet for developers who value simplicity and versatility in their coding
      environment. When you need it, Fleet is an agile code editor for browsing and editing files.
      Fleet’s clean UI and straightforward UX make it even easier to get started immediately.

      ## Maintainers Note
      This is an unofficial install for JetBrains Fleet. This application has been discontinued and
      it can't be downloaded officially. This download relies on the Web Archive, to still provide
      this code editor.

      [JetBrains official statement](https://blog.jetbrains.com/fleet/2025/12/the-future-of-fleet/)
    </description>
